# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132), each finish once its section no longer holds (a GM's change while the event is open): a
# level 66 Warrior at cap 70; 92 open, then cap 71: 92 answered: nothing (not begun); cap 70 again: 92: begun. The
# testimony: 64 open, then the quest completed (a GM): 64 answered 1: nothing (no tradedTestimony, no teleport); the
# quest available, then accepted again (a GM: an addQuest alone leaves a completed quest completed). The win's state
# by GM (Prog 1): 93 open, then the quest set back to available (its section 1 holds, but 93's finish is the accepted
# section's): nothing (not completed, cap 70).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/92 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/93
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=66
levelcap 70
item WarriorsTestimony
login
trigger Maat                            # 92 (1)
levelcap 71                             # a GM, 92 open
finish                                  # cap 71: no section: nothing (not begun)
levelcap 70                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # 92 (1)
finish                                  # begun
trade Maat WarriorsTestimony x1         # 64 (1)
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars completed   # a GM, 64 open
finish option=1                         # completed: 64's finish is the accepted section's: nothing (no teleport)
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars available   # a GM (an addQuest on a completed quest leaves it completed)
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted    # a GM
charvar Quest[3][132]Prog 1             # a GM, the win's Prog
trigger Maat                            # 93
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars available   # a GM, 93 open
finish                                  # available: 93's finish is the accepted section's: nothing
